                + f"For p = {p} = 2^{{{t}}} - 1 (a Mersenne prime) and t = {t}: "
                + "all pairs (a,b) with a = t u,\\; b = a + 1,\\; u \\in \\mathbb{Z}_{\\ge 0}."
            )
        else:
            ans = (
